# November 18, 2026: Cohoes, Waterford and the old Champlain Canal north into Halfmoon. Drawn at random by
# tools/choose.py --state ny (region conf). The region already had the Cohoes Erie locks, Harmony Mills, the side-cut
# locks and the Waterford flight; this batch adds the Old Champlain Canal works from Lock 4 to Lock 8, standing
# buildings in downtown Cohoes and in Waterford village, and the Cluett, Peabody bleachery on Peebles Island.
# Sources were opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py); the American Canal Society's
# Champlain Canal index sheet, the 2019 Champlain Canalway Trail action plan, a Bike It or Hike It trail log, American
# Trails, Lakes to Locks Passage, the Pomeroy Foundation, the Spindle City Historic Society's downtown tour, the
# Waterford Museum's walking tour and visit page, HMdb markers, WAMC, NYS Parks and the Cohoes Music Hall through
# tools/page.py. The National Register forms tried (86000470, 98000135) came back as one-page placeholders and were
# not read.
